      "side": 1,
      "message": "This abort runs before `change_boot` and `boot_to`, the only paths that clear the iDRAC job queue (`change_boot` calls `clear_job_queue` at `external/badfish.py:794`; `boot_to` calls it at line 1107). If a pending BootMode differs from the host record, for example after the record is updated following a failed attempt, every retry fails here. The set failure at line 408 has the same problem: a 400 from `set_bios_attribute` aborts before any clear. At this point in the move nothing legitimate is pending yet, so suggest clearing the job queue and retrying the set once when the pending configuration is the blocker.",
      "revId": "fca26fed4336e1982580ad7002c85dd84097c8c9",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
